abstract: >-
  Research software and benchmark artifacts for controlled evaluation of
  English-Azerbaijani large-language-model capability and reliability,
  including paired multilingual evaluation, abstention analysis, targeted
  Azerbaijani adaptation, and held-out statistical comparison.

